strengths.value:
Overall, I think the introduced problem is interesting in theory:

1. The author did a good job comparing the existing results/conditions of matrix sensing problem with results they introduced. This helped the reviewer to easily understand their intuition behind their ideas;

2. Given the tightness of the bounds achieved, I think the theoretical results are also strong.

